  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "vt.",
      "zh": "提议，建议；打算，计划"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Many experts "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "proposed"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that there should be a limit to the number of high buildings in Shanghai."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "许多专家建议，应该对上海的高楼数量进行限制。"
    }
  ],
  "phrases": [
    {
      "en": "propose doing sth.",
      "zh": "建议做某事"
    },
    {
      "en": "propose to do sth.",
      "zh": "（自己）打算做某事"
    },
    {
      "en": "propose + that 从句",
      "zh": "（虚拟）提议；建议"
    }
  ],
  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "propose, suggest",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "这两个词的词义相近，都可跟名词、动名词和从句，常可互换。不过 propose 比 suggest 正式，在正式场合提出建议须用 propose。propose 后面可跟动词不定式，表达“打算做某事”；suggest 后面不能跟动词不定式。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "propose"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " that Mr. Smith be the leader. 我提议史密斯先生做领导。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The motion was "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "proposed"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " by Mr. Wang and seconded by Mr. Zhang. 这项动议由王先生提出，张先生附议。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "proposed"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " to start early. 我打算早些动身。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "suggested"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " starting early. 我建议早些动身。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
